== T0  G = 0 (flat control) ==
dim A_out = 25 (= n_out^2 = 25),  dim A_in = 16 (= n_in^2 = 16),  center(A_in) = 1  -> type-I factor, tensor split; any marginals extend to a product
== T1  charge dressing: outside also holds H_in ==
dim A_out = 75,  dim A_in = 6 (= 1+4+1 = sum_E n_E^2),  center(A_in) = 3  (= number of charge sectors)
H_in commutes with A_in and A_out (shared central element): True
naive tensor state rho (x) sigma: w(H_in H_in) - w(H_in)w(H_in) = 0.5842  = Var_rho(H_in)  (nonzero => NOT a product state for the dressed pair)
charge-sharp marginal (sector E = 1):  Var(H_in) = 0.0e+00  -> product across the dressed pair; A_in restricted to sector E=1 is B(C^2), a type-I factor
== T2  exact boundary Hamiltonian: outside holds the vacuum projector P_0 of H_tot ==
