(n^2 = 400; eps = relative singular-value resolution used to decide linear (in)dependence)
Reading: lam = 0 -> P_0 is a product projector; the outside gains only |0><0|_in (x) B(K) (charge-like data).
lam != 0 -> Omega has full Schmidt rank n_in (outside-cyclic); b1 P_0 b2 spans all matrix units, A_out = B(H),
A_in = C: no interior subsystem survives. The smallest Schmidt coefficient ~ lam^k sets the precision needed
to exploit it (operator-norm amplification ~ 1/s_min): reconstruction is exact algebraically but resolution-priced.
At coarse eps the computed algebra collapses to the charge-like algebra: eps is a numerical proxy for observational
resolution (an ANALOGY, not a derivation of any gravitational resolution limit).
